  "goodToKnow": "Der Tresor is a safe or vault: Geld im Tresor aufbewahren, einen Tresor knacken. Synonym: der Safe; in banks, das Schließfach is a safe-deposit box. Tresor is also the name of Berlin's legendary techno club, opened in 1991 in the vault of a former department store near Potsdamer Platz. From French trésor (treasure). Plural: die Tresore."
